@startuml
title vMotion Workflow - Workload Balancing

actor Admin
rectangle "vCenter Server" {
  [VM: AppServer01]
  [ESXi Host A]
  [ESXi Host B]
}

Admin --> [VM: AppServer01] : Initiates vMotion
[VM: AppServer01] --> [ESXi Host A] : Current Host
[VM: AppServer01] --> [ESXi Host B] : Target Host

note right of [ESXi Host B]
  vMotion transfers:
  - CPU & Memory state
  - Active sessions
  - Storage pointers
end note

@enduml
